ऑक्सीराइबोज (Deoxyribose) होता है। राइबोज में 2' हाइड्रॉक्सी (–OH) समूह होता है, जिससे इसकी संरचना और प्रतिक्रियाशीलता में अंतर आता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>RNA में न्यूक्लियोटाइड बेस के रूप में थाइमिन (Thymine) के स्थान पर यूरेसिल (Uracil) होता है, जबकि DNA में थाइमिन पाया जाता है।</p></p>\n\n<p>इस प्रकार सही विकल्प है:</p>\n<p>Option B: राइबोज शुगर और यूरेसिल</p>","comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"permalink":"rna-is-different-from-dna-because-rna-contains-2002-marks-4-jly8entjbmuyc3cu.htm","timeAllotted":120000,"updated_time":1585395451,"paperId":"aieee-2002","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"topic":"vitamins-and-nucleic-acids","isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"aieee-2002","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","question_id":"uJ7wL8tXgwpjQUwj","exam":"jee-main","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","languages":["en"],"chapter":"some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry","year":2002,"paperTitle":"AIEEE 2002","difficulty":"easy","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":null,"question":{"en":{"content":"Number of atoms in 558.5 gram Fe (at. wt. of Fe = 55.85 g mol<sup>-1</sup>) is","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"twice that in 60 g carbon"},{"identifier":"B","content":"6.023 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 10<sup>22</sup>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"half that in 8 g He"},{"identifier":"D","content":"558.5 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http:/